/E (The Concordia Concrete Toboggan Team represents Concordia at the Great Northern Concrete Toboggan Race \(GNCTR\), the longest-running undergraduate engineering competition in Canada. The competition involves designing and manufacturing a toboggan that includes reinforced concrete skis, a structural frame, a braking system, and a steering system.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [7]
>>
