/T (The toboggan must include a roll cage for safety and has a unique concrete requirement. The competition stipulates that the only material permitted to come into contact with the snow is reinforced concrete. Concrete is naturally heavy, brittle, and high-friction; teams must think outside the box to engineer high-performance mixes and ski designs.)
